"description":"Ready to earn money with flexible hours and make a difference in your community?\nBecome a Papa Pal.\n\nTo start helping others, download the Papa Pal app.\n\nIf you are a member who is eligible for Papa through your employer or health plan, visit the Papa Care app to get started.\n\nPapa Pals get paid to help older adults and families with things like companionship, transportation, house tasks, and errands.\n\nHow it works:\n\n    • Browse nearby visits in the app and find the ones that work for you. Then, \n    just tap to accept.\n    • The Papa Pal app tracks your drive. All you need to do is show up on time, \n    and have a great visit. That’s it!\n    • You’ll earn an hourly rate, plus bonuses, and other incentives.\n    • Use the app’s dashboard to keep track of your upcoming visits, available \n    visits near you, and more.\n\nWe're committed to creating safe experiences that build trust between our Papa Pals, members, and Papa. To learn more, view our Community Standards at papa.com/community-standards\n\nTo learn more about Papa, visit www.papa.com", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":3.27864999999999984225951266125775873661041259765625, "trackCensoredName":"Papa Pal: Find flexible work", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/papa-pal-find-flexible-work/id1498631076?uo=4", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":890}, 
